00:52:28.140 --> 00:52:31.280
And for a culture book that I talked about
make

00:52:31.280 --> 00:52:34.460
sure to include your mailing address, cuz
it's a physical book.

00:52:34.460 --> 00:52:36.890
And we'll send it to you.

00:52:36.890 --> 00:52:42.050
Next time you're in Vegas go to
tourist.zappos.com to get a free tour.

00:52:42.050 --> 00:52:43.640
We'll pick you up.

00:52:43.640 --> 00:52:45.924
And, you know, the subtitle of my book

00:52:45.924 --> 00:52:48.910
is, the title of my book is Delivering
Happiness.

00:52:48.910 --> 00:52:53.120
The subtitle is A Path to Profits, Passion
and Purpose.

00:52:53.120 --> 00:52:56.830
And you need all three in order to have a
business that will continue to grow.

00:52:56.830 --> 00:52:59.460
And companies, you know, so many companies
in corporate America focus on

00:52:59.460 --> 00:53:02.790
just the profits part of it, and forget
about the passion and purpose.

00:53:02.790 --> 00:53:04.520
And that actually ends up hurting their

00:53:04.520 --> 00:53:06.730
ability to generate profits in the long
term.

00:53:06.730 --> 00:53:09.590
And then I had this weird ah-ha moment
where happiness, you

00:53:09.590 --> 00:53:14.036
know, is really about being able to
combine pleasure, passion, and purpose.

00:53:14.036 --> 00:53:18.320
And so, you know, this whole idea of
happiness as a business model is

00:53:18.320 --> 00:53:20.030
something that, through the book, we want

00:53:20.030 --> 00:53:23.060
to spread to other organizations and other
companies.

00:53:23.060 --> 00:53:24.850
And I think we're just at the beginning of

00:53:24.850 --> 00:53:27.190
the very special time where we're all
hyper connected.

00:53:27.190 --> 00:53:28.666
Information travels so quickly.

00:53:28.666 --> 00:53:32.770
Companies culture, companies brand, are,
that lag time is becoming less

00:53:32.770 --> 00:53:37.230
and less and really, that's how we've
approached things at Zappos.

00:53:37.230 --> 00:53:39.280
And you know, just want to leave you with
thinking

00:53:39.280 --> 00:53:40.730
about, what percentage of the time do you
want to

00:53:40.730 --> 00:53:43.200
spend reading up on the science of
happiness and how

00:53:43.200 --> 00:53:46.760
can that help yourself personally, your
brand or your business.

00:53:46.760 --> 00:53:48.320
And the research shows that companies that

00:53:48.320 --> 00:53:50.780
have a higher purpose actually generate
more

00:53:50.780 --> 00:53:53.040
profits in the long term and people

00:53:53.040 --> 00:53:57.056
that have a higher purpose actually are
happier.

00:53:57.056 --> 00:53:59.060
You know, think about what is your
company's

00:53:59.060 --> 00:54:03.030
higher purpose and what is your own higher
purpose.

00:54:03.030 --> 00:54:06.020
And if through this presentation you've
been inspired to make customers

00:54:06.020 --> 00:54:10.112
happier through customer service or make
employees happier by focusing more

00:54:10.112 --> 00:54:13.680
on culture and, and figuring out the
vision or just make

00:54:13.680 --> 00:54:17.950
yourself happier by reading up more on
this whole science of happiness.

00:54:17.950 --> 00:54:21.660
If any of those things have happened, then
I'll have done my part in helping

00:54:21.660 --> 00:54:25.520
us fulfill our own higher purpose which

00:54:25.520 --> 00:54:28.640
is all about delivering happiness to the
